# Metamorphic Blast's Rabbit mode changes base power and toughness, colors and creature types, nothing else (CR 613.4b, 205.1a):
# Bot2's Ornithopter (a 0/2 flying Artifact Creature - Thopter) is a white Rabbit with base 0/1 and still flies and is still an
# artifact creature. Bot1 casts the instant on Bot2's turn, once the Ornithopter has resolved; the effect ends at cleanup (CR 514.2), so on Bot1's
# turn the Ornithopter is a 0/2 Thopter again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Metamorphic Blast
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

